AUDIO: 'I hope you all learned a little bit more about Vic and CakeWallet and what they\'re working on and what\'s next and kind of the nuances of Bitcoin privacy. If you guys have any guest recommendations going forward, let me know. I would love to hear. And if you enjoy these interviews, you can become'

